{
  "name": "money-ledger-engineering",
  "description": "Correct money handling and an internal double-entry ledger end to end: find float money, choose representations and rounding, build an append-only idempotent PostgreSQL ledger with locking and snapshots, convert currencies, reconcile against Stripe and bank exports, audit, sync to QuickBooks Online or Xero, and prove balance invariants with property tests in the chosen stack.",
